  m_Name: L07_BurjAlArab
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Cutrium.Presentation::Cutrium.Presentation.Landmark.LandmarkDefinition
  _landmarkId: burj-al-arab
  _displayTitle: Burj Al Arab
  _shortDescription: The sail-shaped Burj Al Arab rises from an artificial island
    off Dubai's coast. Its bold silhouette and lavish interiors have made it one
    of modern Dubai's most recognisable landmarks. An atrium nearly 180 metres high
    and a helipad projecting over the sea give the hotel's architecture an unexpected
    sense of scale.
  _sector: Dubai / UNITED ARAB EMIRATES
  _displayTitleTurkish: "Bur\xE7 el-Arab"
  _shortDescriptionTurkish: "Yelken bi\xE7imli Burj Al Arab, Dubai k\u0131y\u0131s\u0131ndaki
    yapay bir ada \xFCzerinde y\xFCkselir. Cesur sil\xFCeti ve g\xF6steri\u015Fli
    i\xE7 mek\xE2nlar\u0131, yap\u0131y\u0131 modern Dubai\u2019nin en tan\u0131nan
    simgelerinden biri yapm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. Yakla\u015F\u0131k 180 metre y\xFCksekli\u011Findeki
    dev atriyumu ve denizin \xFCzerinde uzanan helikopter pisti, otelin mimarisine
    beklenmedik bir \xF6l\xE7ek duygusu katar."
  _sectorTurkish: "Dubai / B\u0130RLE\u015E\u0130K ARAP EM\u0130RL\u0130KLER\u0130"
